15
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,733
Were you stressed that day?

16
00:00:51,733 --> 00:00:54,800
But I hoped for one of them more.

17
00:00:54,833 --> 00:00:56,266
If I can decide to date a person

18
00:00:56,266 --> 00:00:57,766
in just ten days,

19
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,600
that's so not me.

20
00:01:00,033 --> 00:01:01,100
I feel like

21
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:03,700
