in this certain environment.

22
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,833
If we leave here,
things might be different.

23
00:01:06,066 --> 00:01:07,166
[48-Hour Countdown]

24
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:07,933
[We're wavering between yes and no.]

25
00:01:07,933 --> 00:01:08,766
I invite Autumn.

26
00:01:09,333 --> 00:01:09,966
[Date Invitation Card]
My whole reason

27
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,033
