28
00:01:11,033 --> 00:01:11,966
I want to get closer to her.

29
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,233
So I'm only inviting her.

30
00:01:14,566 --> 00:01:15,800
[48-Hour Countdown]

31
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:16,666
[We're closing the distance.]

32
00:01:16,733 --> 00:01:18,333
Ma's voting on day two.

33
00:01:18,333 --> 00:01:20,400
Zhang Xuefei, two Moonstones.

34
00:01:21,066 --> 00:01:23,100
I didn't expect
he'd give me two Moonstones.

35
00:01:23,433 --> 00:01:25,666
I think love is seeing someone

36
00:01:25,666 --> 00:01:27,266
and accepting all of them.

37
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:29,100
[48-Hour Countdown]

38
00:01:29,100 --> 00:01:30,000
[We're finding eternity in the moment.]

39
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,166
[Time will reveal]

40
00:01:31,166 --> 00:01:31,733
