55
00:02:23,633 --> 00:02:24,466
Love you.

56
00:02:24,466 --> 00:02:25,300
[Checking the Look]

57
00:02:25,433 --> 00:02:26,866
Okay.

58
00:02:26,866 --> 00:02:27,700
