I'm going.

59
00:02:27,700 --> 00:02:28,600
[Can't Wait]

60
00:02:28,633 --> 00:02:29,566
Go.

61
00:02:31,033 --> 00:02:32,433
I'm leaving.

62
00:02:32,433 --> 00:02:33,300
Have fun.

63
