92
00:03:18,233 --> 00:03:19,366
Yeah, right.

93
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,333
Let's go.

94
00:03:20,333 --> 00:03:20,933
Go.

95
00:03:20,933 --> 00:03:22,800
Go. Let's head out.

96
00:03:23,466 --> 00:03:26,100
